400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 317 0 R
/E (This toolkit was developed as part of an intensive international Training Course on comprehensive sexuality education, held in Ribes de Freser, Girona, Spain, from 10 to 16 of April 2026. The project brought together 17 youth workers, educators, and facilitators from across Europe to explore how non-formal education can support open, inclusive, and empowering conversations about sexuality with young people.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
401 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 317 0 R
/E (The training created a space for critical exchange among professionals from diverse cultural, national, and educational backgrounds. Some participants already had experience working with sexuality education, while others were beginning to explore the topic in their youth work practice. This diversity enriched the learning process and allowed participants to reflect on how sexuality education is understood, discussed, and sometimes silenced in different local contexts.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
402 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 317 0 R
/E (Throughout the course, participants strengthened their competencies in inclusive, intersectional, and context-sensitive sexuality education. The programme focused on supporting youth workers to address sensitive or taboo topics in safe, participatory, and empowering ways. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
