/Pg 43 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
736 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1399 0 R
/E ( Expected reflection: Not without asking or checking first. Even if people are close friends or usually hug, this does not automatically mean they consent to kissing.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
