/P 364 0 R
/T (At the end of the workshop, facilitators can ask participants what topics they would like to explore in future sessions. This helps build trust and makes the programme more responsive to the needs of the group.)
/E (At the end of the workshop, facilitators can ask participants what topics they would like to explore in future sessions. This helps build trust and makes the programme more responsive to the needs of the group.)
/Pg 59 0 R
