/Title (Ultimately, the project highlights the role of youth workers as facilitators of trust, care, and critical thinking. By addressing sexuality education through respect, consent, inclusion, and dignity, youth work can contribute to healthier relationships, stronger self-awareness, reduced stigma, and more equal communities. The toolkit invites educators and youth workers to continue adapting, testing, and improving these methods in their own local contexts, helping young people across Europe and the world access the knowledge, confidence, and support they need.)
