/Title (A central aim of the project was not only to exchange knowledge, but also to create practical educational tools that could be adapted and used in different youth work settings. During the Training Course, participants worked in international groups to design, develop, and test their own workshop concepts. These activities were shaped by their professional experience, local realities, and the needs of the young people they work with.)
