/Title (For a 30-minute version, facilitators should keep the presentation short and focus mainly on anonymous questions and basic concepts. For a 90-minute version, facilitators can include more interactive elements, such as small-group discussions, scenario analysis, role-play, or a myth-busting exercise.)
