/Title (If participants raise questions related to trauma, violence, abuse, coercion, or unsafe situations, facilitators should not try to handle these alone in the group. They should follow safeguarding procedures and refer the young person to appropriate trusted adults, counsellors, protection services, or local support organisations.)
